      "content": "it sounds a bit scary when u say dvt. i'm really trying to avoid going back to the hospital if i can help it because the last visit was such a hassle and so expensive. do u think there is any way i could just try to manage it at home for a couple days to see if it goes down? like maybe an ice pack or some ibuprofen would help it settle?",
